{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fearsome Challengers take to the skies in action-packed battles for glory!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/e805b4686ae81e69d278b2ea3ff4da4a.avif?t=1766016423\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Airborne Platformer Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver through flying arenas, using unique weapons and abilities to defeat opponents or to knock them out of the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/f86e7fee0abffce0a4189fd6d8f649cb.avif?t=1766016423\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Challenger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick from a variety of distinct fighters, each with their own abilities and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/977eed367dec54258d04098f8df1fbc6.avif?t=1766016423\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Co-Op Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for aerial dominance alone, or alongside a friend. Become the last Challenger standing in death-match, or work to capture your opponents' flag in CTF. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/8e399885fafdd2dfac8cd64e3f3de994.avif?t=1766016423\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995940?t=1766016423","background_raw":"